  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1002.16 Department staff",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1002.16 “Department staff” means an employee or agent of the department who is authorized by the department to review and discuss preliminary plans for subdivision or ISDS, or both, to advise on modifications, and to approve plans for subdivisions or ISDS, or both, and installations of ISDS for the department.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1000) #11184, eff 10-1-16; ss by #14486, eff 2-1-26, EXPIRES: 2-1-36",
